<title>Space &gt; $$$. No BIN $10 shipping auction with only $10 starting bids!</title>
<description>All items will have a starting bid of $10.

Here are the rules for this auction:

* All bids must be in whole US dollars.
* All items have starting prices, please don't bid below that. A legal bid is one that meets or exceeds the Starting Bid, and exceeds the previous legal bid.
* I will conduct the sale through geekmail, you can expect a mail the day after the sale completes asking for your address for the sale. I'll use this address to calculate shipping.
* PayPal or Venmo will be fine and I expect to pay the associated fees. I can do local pickup in Bellevue, WA (98006) area anytime - let me know and we can set something up to avoid shipping.
* Winners of the item must pay in full within 2 days of winning an item, or the sale may be cancelled, unless we have made some other arrangement. Communication is the key to all happiness.
* I reserve the right to remove or change the listing for any item in this auction at any time before the auction has been declared ended. I won't remove an item from the auction if it has bids unless I have notified the bidder(s) first and explained the situation. I also may add items along the way.

SHIPPING

* Shipping will be paid by the buyer but to a maximum of $10.
* I will combine shipping for multiple wins.
* I will typically ship within 48 hours of receipt of payment.
* Ships (or can be picked up) from 98006 (Bellevue, WA)
* Sorry, no international shipping at this time.

OTHER NOTES

* The auction will end around 7pm PST on THURSDAY evening of the 1st of January. Don't snipe, it's mean. I will let bids continue on active items until there has been no bid for more than 1 hour.</description>

